This repository is a fork of the upstream project, maintained for self-hosted
Docker / Unraid deployment. Modifications in this fork are limited to:

  - removal of packaging artifacts, sample media and build outputs from the repo
  - rewritten Dockerfile (three-stage build, healthcheck, OCI labels)
  - GHCR-based multi-arch CI workflow (replacing the Docker Hub workflow)
  - added Unraid compose file and CA template, and deployment documentation

All application logic, UI, data formats and APIs originate from the upstream
project and remain under AGPLv3.

